      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Originally part of Spanish land grant Potrero Nuevo, Dogpatch’s history runs parallel to neighboring Potrero Hill.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dogpatch%2C_San_Francisco",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1856 San Francisco Cordage opened a massive Manila rope factory that powered ships across the Pacific.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
